      "created_at": "2014-03-29T00:57:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>According to the available information, you will be able to buy the Uprising expansion, the miniatures, and the extra miniatures, but not the power pack. (I'm guessing the power pack will be available as a promo at conventions.) Their stated timetable is December 2014, at least for the Kickstarter backers.</p>",
