      "created_at": "2014-03-29T05:52:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>&gt;G Does not do KS Exclusives, so while the Promo Power Pack won't necessarily be directly for sale, it will be available at cons and probably (like the promo heroes) be available after the line is finished for purchase all at once.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Everything else (Core1, Core Minis, Expansion1, Expansion Minis) will be available ast dpt stated.</p>",
